  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog Android SDK's dd-sdk-android-trace-api module: the tracing contract - DatadogTracer, DatadogSpan, DatadogSpanContext and DatadogScope - that DatadogNet.Trace.Android implements. Built against dd-sdk-android 3.12.1. Arrives as a dependency of DatadogNet.Trace.Android; reference it directly only to code against the interfaces.",
